<title>UK: IBCA appoints senior economist for Latin America.</title>
<headline>IBCA appoints senior economist for Latin America.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Tuesday it had appointed Richard Fox as senior economist in charge of Latin America.</p>
<p>Fox is currently Chief Economist for Latin America and Eastern Europe at Standard Chartered Bank, IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>Before that he worked at the International Monetary Fund (IMF) in Washington and prior to that was head of the balance of payments capital account group at the Bank of England, said IBCA.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
